h\u2019s adaptive Gauntlet can transform into Blades, Flail, or Fists, each offering unique combat and movement abilities. Switch freely between them to craft your own playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras/GIF-Unique-Weapon.gif?t=1744309869\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras/Unique-Bosses-with-Unique-Mechanics.png?t=1744309869\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your reflexes and strategic thinking against more than 20 unique bosses!\u00a0 Learn their mechanics, exploit their vulnerabilities, and evolve your strategy through every phase of the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras/GIF-Unique-Bosses.gif?t=1744309869\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras/Variety-of-Character-Builds-_-Abilities.png?t=1744309869\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your weapon proficiency through a skill tree and equip various enhancements to gain an edge in battle. Experiment with different builds and tailor Inayah\u2019s abilities to match your preferred way of playing! <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras/Character-Builds.gif?t=1744309869\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras/Beautiful-2D-Art-_-Hand-Drawn-Frame-by-Frame-Animations.png?t=1744309869\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br> The game boasts stunning 2D art and meticulously hand-drawn frame-by-frame animations.<br>This commitment to high-quality aesthetics ensures that each moment in INAYAH is a feast for the eyes, setting it apart from other 2D platformers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras/2D-Art.gif?t=1744309869\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choices matter. Interact with the inhabitants of this unforgiving world, uncover hidden lore, and shape Inayah\u2019s destiny. Offer help or follow your own path, and carefully consider the consequences of your actions. Unlock multiple endings and see what fate awaits Inayah and her world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an unforgettable journey in <strong>&quot;INAYAH \u2013 Life After Gods&quot;</strong>, where challenging trials and emotional stories await on your path to finding home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/extras/balloon.png?t=1744309869\" /></p>","developers":["Exogenesis Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199390/header.jpg?t=1744309869","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Headup Games GmbH & Co. KG and Exogenesis Information Technology - FZCO. INAYAH \u2013 Life After Gods, its logo, Exogenesis Studios and the Exogensis Studios logo are trademarks of Exogenesis Information Technology \u2013 FZCO, UAE. Headup and the Headup logo are trademarks of Headup Games GmbH & Co. KG, Germany.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cla